         "id": "SECTION_prerequisites",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "### Prerequisites\n\nWe suggest you first read the texts about navigating the menus (<htcite0>), about the menu options (<htcite1>), about links and sources (<htcite2>), and about the top-right area (<htcite3>). The prerequisites are the first section of a page: they list the texts recommended before the current one.",
