      {
         "id": "SECTION_introduction",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "### Introduction\n\nEvery text in History Tracers is organized in a similar way. Knowing this structure makes reading easier, because you always know where to find the recommendations, the subject, the sources, and the activities. This guide describes the parts of a page.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ]
      },
      {
         "id": "SECTION_general",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "### General section\n\nThe general sections form the main body of the page. Each one has a title and develops a part of the subject, with explanations, examples, images, and tables. They follow a logical order, from the first concepts to the most complete.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ]
      },
      {
         "id": "SECTION_conclusion",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "### Conclusion\n\nThe conclusion closes the text. It summarizes the main ideas and, sometimes, invites the reader to continue with the next content.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ]
      },
      {
         "id": "SECTION_exercise",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "### Exercise\n\nSome pages finish with an exercise. It lets you practise what you have just read and check your understanding through questions and activities.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ]
      },
      {
         "id": "SECTION_families",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "### Families\n\nFamily pages, in *Genealogy*, are special. Besides the sections described above, they contain an internal book about the family, with its own indexes and navigation. This book lets you browse the family history page by page, from the first mentioned ancestors to the most recent generations appearing on the page.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ]
      }
